      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Hello! Welcome to the training operator demonstrator in mixed reality.
    You will have a menu that will be showed when you look at your left hand, all
    the information about what you have to do id displayed in each showcase on a
    big screen on your right. Every time that you finish the step, press NEXT on
    your left palm to see the next step. The 3 showcases will be: Welding with human
    robot collaboration, battery assembly with human robot collaboration and manual
    assembly of the MBS with HMI'
